    <briefdescription>
<para>Two-additive-factor gaussian model class. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class implements a two-additive-factor model defined by <formula id="315">\[ dr_t = \varphi(t) + x_t + y_t \]</formula> where <formula id="295">$ x_t $</formula> and <formula id="297">$ y_t $</formula> are defined by <formula id="316">\[ dx_t = -a x_t dt + \sigma dW^1_t, x_0 = 0 \]</formula> <formula id="317">\[ dy_t = -b y_t dt + \sigma dW^2_t, y_0 = 0 \]</formula> and <formula id="318">$ dW^1_t dW^2_t = \rho dt $</formula>.</para><para><xrefsect id="bug_1_bug000010"><xreftitle>Bug</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>This class was not tested enough to guarantee its functionality.</para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
    <location file="/models/shortrate/twofactormodels/g2.hpp" line="55" bodyfile="/models/shortrate/twofactormodels/g2.hpp" bodystart="53" bodyend="120"/>
